codex
The first proof is sound, but the audit exposed a clarity improvement worth making: its postcondition used a generic register-transition summary and then needed an external mathematical explanation to identify that summary with the prompt’s Fib4 recurrence. I’m tightening the theorem so its postcondition is the recurrence itself—base cases `0,0,2,0` plus the four-term step—and changing the loop to preserve an explicit index. This makes the implementation-to-contract link machine-visible in `spec.k`.
apply patch
