+```
+
+Actual result: exit `0`, final `<k> .K </k>`, `<exc> NoExc </exc>`, and
+`<exit-code> 0 </exit-code>`.  All assertions in `smoke.py` therefore passed.
+
+```bash
+python3 test_solution.py
+```
+
+Actual output and exit:
+
+```text
